21
00:02:17.430 --> 00:02:22.710
For the action, she made it incredibly easy, just one single click straight to a My Morning view.

22
00:02:23.350 --> 00:02:27.210
Then, the reward was a daily summary with a surprising productivity insight.

23
00:02:27.850 --> 00:02:32.670
And finally, for the investment, she let users customize their task templates and personal colors,

24
00:02:32.670 --> 00:02:35.110
