By removing friction and delivering that unpredictable value, VLOX more than doubled its engagement.

27
00:02:44.230 --> 00:02:49.130
Daily active users over monthly active users jumped from 15% before the habit loop, all

28
00:02:49.130 --> 00:02:50.910
